  - name: "The NanoFEM Developers"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Research-grade finite element framework for nanoscale mechanics:
  Eringen nonlocal elasticity, strain-gradient and couple-stress theories,
  surface elasticity, and auxetic metamaterials. Phase 0: architecture only.
